[{"title":"夜闻鹤唳有感","author":"于谦","text":"斋居无四邻，庭空篆烟冷。\n明月扬素辉，脩篁散疏影。\n双鹤向我鸣，鼓翅复引领。\n灵风振缟衣，露华浥丹顶。\n清响彻云霄，万籁悉以屏。\n芝田在何许，遥遥隔尘境。\n欲去还未能，蹉跎驻光景。\n听此融心神，令人发深省。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31807,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花图为严宪副题","author":"于谦","text":"我家住在西湖曲，种得梅花绕茅屋。\n雪消风暖花正开，千树珑璁缀香玉。\n有时抱琴花下弹，有时展易花前读。\n浩然清气满乾坤，坐觉心胸绝尘俗。\n一从游宦来京师，几度梅花入梦思。\n为君展卷题诗处，还忆开窗对月时。\n醉墨淋漓染毫素，笔底生春若神助。\n调羹鼎鼐愧无功，何时却踏西湖路。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31808,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"无题","author":"于谦","text":"朝在太行南，暮在太行北。\n问余何事苦悤悤，鞍马驱驰常是客。\n笑而不答心自知，眷恋浮名好是痴。\n昨日朱颜如殢酒，今朝白发已成丝。\n远离乡国空劳梦，怅望庭闱有所思。\n君宠亲恩俱未报，窃禄无功补盛时。\n太行山，不可攀。\n谁似山头白云好，才成霖雨便知还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31809,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨后写怀","author":"于谦","text":"甘雨洗尘寰，爽气涤烦襟。\n参差庭前树，蓊蔚敷繁阴。\n凯风泠然来，好鸟送佳音。\n俯瞰池塘水，粼粼清且深。\n中有双鲤鱼，随波恣浮沉。\n睹兹节物佳，击节动讴吟。\n万事毋足论，大化契我心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31810,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"池边散步","author":"于谦","text":"临流树影半欹斜，晴波滉漾走金蛇。\n帘前燕子掠飞蝶，池面鱼儿吹柳花。\n游丝牵风白日静，落红满地青春赊。\n数声啼鸟助幽兴，门巷彷佛山人家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31811,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"无题 其一","author":"于谦","text":"名节重泰山，利欲轻鸿毛。\n所以古志士，终身甘缊袍。\n胡椒八百斛，千载遗腥臊。\n一钱付江水，死后有馀褒。\n苟图身富贵，朘剥民脂膏。\n国法纵未及，公论安所逃。\n作诗寄深意，感慨心忉忉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31812,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"无题 其二","author":"于谦","text":"篝灯夜窗下，抚卷坐来久。\n泛观古豪杰，际遇良不偶。\n伊周及房杜，股肱戴元首。\n韩范与富欧，曲蘖成醴酒。\n勋业正当时，功名垂弗朽。\n李广命不侯，冯唐空白首。\n间关逐常调，遇事亦掣肘。\n赋命有疾徐，奔竞适足丑。\n掩书对明月，且尽杯中酒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31813,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄内","author":"于谦","text":"结发为夫妻，恩爱两相好。\n生男与育女，所期在偕老。\n我生叨国恩，显宦亦何早。\n班资忝亚卿，巡抚历边徼。\n自愧才力薄，无功答穹昊。\n勉力效驱驰，庶以赎天讨。\n汝居辇毂下，闺门日幽悄。\n大儿在故乡，地远音信杳。\n二女正娇痴，但索梨与枣。\n况复家清贫，生计日草草。\n汝惟内助勤，何曾事温饱。\n而我非不知，报主事非小。\n忠孝世所珍，贤良国之宝。\n尺书致慇勤，此意谅能表。\n岁寒松柏心，彼此永相保。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31814,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忆老婢","author":"于谦","text":"吾家有老婢，行年近五十。\n虽云极丑陋，所幸少过失。\n我昔少年时，垂髫发如漆。\n锐意取功名，辛苦事纸笔。\n双亲命老婢，给使读书室。\n余时方气刚，未知抚爱术。\n斯须不如意，骂詈信口出。\n老婢受不辞，未始怨且泣。\n我壮忝科名，旋登显要职。\n老婢亦欣慰，且言所愿毕。\n家人自南来，致意我家室。\n此意久未报，吾心恒郁郁。\n作诗寄所怀，相见应有日。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31815,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画二首 其二","author":"于谦","text":"同云蔽天风怒号，飞来雪片如鹅毛。\n须臾群峰失翠色，等閒平地生银涛。\n探梅诗客多清趣，瘦蹇冲寒溪上去。\n只闻风送暗香来，不识梅花在何处。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31816,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"日暮绛州道中","author":"于谦","text":"行行度山冈，望望指城郭。\n云收雨意散，天晚日色薄。\n万籁鸣笙竽，清风满岩壑。\n虽云途路遥，此景殊不恶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31817,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题壁间画","author":"于谦","text":"看山如看画，听水如听琴。\n水流碧溪转，山高白云深。\n俯仰天地间，万物本无心。\n松风飒然来，为我涤烦襟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31818,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寒夜煮茶歌","author":"于谦","text":"老夫不得寐，无奈更漏长。\n霜痕月影与雪色，为我庭户增辉光。\n直庐数椽少邻并，苦空寂寞如僧房。\n萧条厨传无长物，地炉爇火烹茶汤。\n初如清波露蟹眼，次若轻车转羊肠。\n须臾腾波鼓浪不可遏，展开雀舌浮甘香。\n一瓯啜罢尘虑净，顿觉唇吻皆清凉。\n胸中虽无文字五千卷，新诗亦足追晚唐。\n玉川子，贫更狂。\n书生本无富贵相，得意何必誇膏梁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31819,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"落花","author":"于谦","text":"春来又春去，花落复花开。\n老少寻常事，何须废酒杯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31820,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮春","author":"于谦","text":"槐柳拂云长，清阴覆短墙。\n群芳俱落尽，祗有菜花黄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31821,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小楼即景","author":"于谦","text":"楼外青山好，楼前绿树多。\n阑干知几曲，曲曲费吟哦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31822,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶题三首 其一","author":"于谦","text":"日落风欲静，鸟啼人自閒。\n白云如解事，成雨便归山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31823,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶题三首 其二","author":"于谦","text":"倦鸟投林处，斜阳在树枝。\n薄云收未尽，山雨乍晴时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31824,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶题三首 其三","author":"于谦","text":"薰风何处来，吹我庭前树。\n啼鸟爱繁阴，飞来不飞去。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31825,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏景","author":"于谦","text":"帘捲薰风动，庭空白日长。\n可怜双蛱蝶，犹恋菜花黄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31826,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜雨","author":"于谦","text":"雨洗乾坤净，恩沾品物新。\n俯观寰海内，无复皱眉人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31827,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"日暮","author":"于谦","text":"归鸦争绕树，落日半衔山。\n微雨晚来歇，孤云独自还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31828,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋意","author":"于谦","text":"池上秋风起，池中秋水凉。\n芙蓉好颜色，可惜不禁霜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31829,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春夜","author":"于谦","text":"长风送华月，照我庭前树。\n宿鸟忽惊飞，双双背人去。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31830,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"清明日戏题","author":"于谦","text":"才看花满枝，又见花零落。\n春光不自留，莫怪东风恶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31831,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日晚景","author":"于谦","text":"浮云含雨意，斜日弄波光。\n暮景难留恋，谁言白昼长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31832,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"纪梦中作","author":"于谦","text":"判袂不辞难，出门山更山。\n来年二三月，伫听凯歌还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31833,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日散步庭下偶题","author":"于谦","text":"雨过苔痕净，庭空日影迟。\n好怀谁会得，啼鸟在花枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31834,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"清源分司林檎去时始见开花自平阳还则结实久矣因成二十字","author":"于谦","text":"去时树开花，来时花结子。\n如何马上人，来往只如此。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31835,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟中","author":"于谦","text":"远道疲鞍马，舟行得暂閒。\n推篷看风景，祗见太行山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31836,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题金璧山水二首 其一","author":"于谦","text":"溪山疏雨歇，水木散清阴。\n樵唱知何处，白云深更深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31837,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题金璧山水二首 其二","author":"于谦","text":"花发东风软，鸟啼春昼閒。\n抱琴出门去，随意看青山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31838,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送赵参议之浙江","author":"于谦","text":"枫宸初拜命，江浙已驰名。\n到任君应喜，西湖彻底清。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31839,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"并州北门城楼","author":"于谦","text":"塞北穷冬候，无风也自寒。\n楼高窥朔漠，无事莫凭阑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31840,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冻鹊","author":"于谦","text":"独占高枝立，天寒伴侣稀。\n明朝春意动，好向上林飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31