text":"莫把层楼倚，楼高接远天。\n东风乡国路，直在白云边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31848,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春思","author":"于谦","text":"春色二分过，花枝一半开。\n天涯芳草遍，游子几时回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31849,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"胆瓶梅","author":"于谦","text":"数点枝头雪，分明露化工。\n恐教尘土涴，移入玉壶中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31850,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋意","author":"于谦","text":"溽暑随风散，微凉趁雨生。\n萧萧树头叶，已解作秋声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31851,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋闺二首 其一","author":"于谦","text":"散步瑶阶下，庭空不见人。\n回头顾明月，惟有影随身。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31852,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋闺二首 其二","author":"于谦","text":"莫向池边去，芙蓉花正开。\n近来憔悴甚，应是被风猜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31853,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"七夕二首 其一","author":"于谦","text":"夜静银河冷，天高玉露清。\n双星缘底事，千古若为情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31854,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"七夕二首 其二","author":"于谦","text":"华月窗间过，凉风扇底生。\n抚时追往事，幽恨不分明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31855,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春寒病中自慰","author":"于谦","text":"别离惊岁换，老病怯春寒。\n脱帻拥衾卧，移书就枕看。\n暗将归计卜，聊把客怀宽。\n早晚金台路，东风拂绣鞍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31856,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冬至日思亲","author":"于谦","text":"客里逢佳节，天涯忆老亲。\n葭灰初应候，梅蕊渐回春。\n醉讶朱颜好，愁添白发新。\n孤云恒在望，翘首欲沾巾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31857,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"郑州遇学正沈平之","author":"于谦","text":"一从分袂后，两地各悽然。\n道路千山隔，音书几度传。\n相逢成感慨，欲别更留连。\n清话休辞久，重来又隔年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31858,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜雪","author":"于谦","text":"冻迷鸳瓦冷，花簇凤城春。\n和气成三白，欢声洽万人。\n楼台失远近，草木动精神。\n丰稔何须卜，尧年瑞应频。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31859,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"八月四日夜月","author":"于谦","text":"谁将白玉钩，挂向柳梢头。\n镜缺姮娥恨，眉颦越女羞。\n生光从此夜，满魄待中秋。\n但愿团圆夕，相看入凤楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31860,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谷日喜晴","author":"于谦","text":"谷日晴明好，丰年信可期。\n雪消风澹澹，天暖日迟迟。\n东作因时起，西成与岁宜。\n忧民无限意，对此暂舒眉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31861,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"因观王金陵效白乐天何处难忘酒之作，喜其切近人情，乃亦效颦，非敢追踪前人，不过遣兴而已二首 其一","author":"于谦","text":"何处难忘酒，隆冬客异乡。\n门前风凛凛，天外雪茫茫。\n候馆人烟少，前途道路长。\n此时无一盏，安得解愁肠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31862,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"因观王金陵效白乐天何处难忘酒之作，喜其切近人情，乃亦效颦，非敢追踪前人，不过遣兴而已二首 其二","author":"于谦","text":"何处难忘酒，承恩昼锦荣。\n宾朋相慰藉，儿女共攀迎。\n白发庭闱健，青春事业成。\n此时无一盏，安得叙欢情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31863,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"绛州分司谩兴","author":"于谦","text":"高居远尘世，嘉木结繁阴。\n叶密藏山果，池清立水禽。\n帘垂花隔户，石迸笋穿林。\n镇日看书坐，翛然解俗襟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31864,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暑月将自太原巡汴","author":"于谦","text":"三晋冲寒到，中州冒暑回。\n山川元不改，节候自相催。\n绿树连天暗，红葵向日开。\n太行云缥缈，搔首意徘徊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31865,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"回朝偶题","author":"于谦","text":"老去惊时换，公馀觉昼长。\n池风荷偃翠，林雨杏垂黄。\n旧业存书卷，閒情付药方。\n偶来北窗下，高枕梦羲皇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31866,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望雨无寐晓起偶题","author":"于谦","text":"闻鸡推枕起，曙色渐分明。\n树映旌旗影，风传鼓角声。\n云霓常在望，天地岂无情。\n坐待甘霖降，群黎各遂生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31867,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次日阴云密布不雨复散","author":"于谦","text":"泼墨浓云布，漫空雨意悬。\n斯须露红日，依旧睹青天。\n祈祷知何益，焦枯亦可怜。\n菲才膺重寄，值此更悽然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31868,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"太行途中杂咏","author":"于谦","text":"碗子城边路，年来几度过。\n山川认行色，花鸟熟鸣珂。\n恋阙情何限，瞻云思转多。\n壮怀成激烈，弹剑欲高歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31869,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"到泽州","author":"于谦","text":"信马天将暮，离山路转平。\n川萦太行驿，树绕泽州城。\n落日翻旗影，长风送鼓声。\n孤云在天际，回首若为情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31870,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题古寺","author":"于谦","text":"古寺知何代，荒凉倚翠微。\n凝尘生佛面，落叶拥禅扉。\n殿迥香镫寂，廊空乌鹊飞。\n塔铃风外语，应似怨斜晖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31871,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻朝觐官有喜且以致勉励之意于属吏云","author":"于谦","text":"圣主当天运，诸侯述职归。\n佩声辞禁阙，香霭散朝衣。\n戒敕颁天语，生成显化机。\n勉旃图报称，莫使寸心违。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31872,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日即事","author":"于谦","text":"案牍閒清昼，歌谣遍里闾。\n光风回细柳，甘雨洗嘉蔬。\n遣兴杯中物，消愁几上书。\n所期民物阜，此外复何如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31873,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游春","author":"于谦","text":"满路香尘起，寻春思欲迷。\n树晴莺出谷，溪暖燕衔泥。\n玉勒嘶芳草，青楼瞰大堤。\n风光无限好，都在画桥西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31874,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春愁","author":"于谦","text":"谩说韶光好，关心别有愁。\n雨悭禾未种，土渴麦难抽。\n吏牍勤披检，民风肆访求。\n寻芳游冶子，争识庙堂忧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31875,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"连日大风至十八日午后乃止喜赋","author":"于谦","text":"狂风当午歇，庭户绝纤尘。\n落蕊粘芳草，游丝挽暮春。\n间关莺语滑，来往燕飞频。\n纵是韶光晚，相看亦可人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31876,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"日晚至文水","author":"于谦","text":"溪明寒日落，树暝夕烟生。\n飞鸟随人语，长风扰树声。\n鼓笳悲远戍，车马厌脩程。\n骑火前村起，山城候吏迎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31877,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日大风感怀","author":"于谦","text":"远塞足风沙，春深不见花。\n层冰犹度马，弱柳未藏鸦。\n易醉愁边酒，频归梦里家。\n凭阑一搔首，心绪乱如麻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":31878,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]